# Action prerequisite flow; no native reachability or runtime acceptance claim.
direction: down
classes: {
  start: {style: {fill: "#25364B"; font-color: "#FFFFFF"; bold: true; stroke-width: 3}}
}
Selected: "Start here · Client-selected location\nActual search result · preserve every path byte\nApp launch: identifier AND applicationPath" {class: start}
Input: "Literal absolute input\nSearch ceiling: 8192 UTF-8 bytes\nSource length is no presence/action verdict"
Lookup: "Resolve source and expanded target\nExisting stat/realpath route is PATH_MAX-limited\nComponent lookup is only a candidate building block"
Classify: "Native payload / bundle / identity / registration\nReplacement long-location route unresolved\nNo guessed type or unknown registration negative"
Submit: "One original-location native request\nBoth controls · existing configuration\n3 s acknowledgment wait; earlier core deadline"
Result: "Acknowledgment / failed / unknown transport\nIndependent delivery, Finder selection and copy witness\nActual long-file and constrained-app outcomes pending"
Failure: "Designed repair · unimplemented\nSize / link bound / uncertain metadata → failed\nDependency only for established missing prerequisite"
Selected -> Input: "1 · explicit action with both controls"
Input -> Lookup: "2 · valid syntax, not actionability"
Lookup -> Classify: "3 · presence established"
Lookup -> Failure: "3 · refusal / uncertainty"
Classify -> Failure: "4 · failure, not fabricated absence"
Classify -> Submit: "4 · complete prerequisites; route still required"
Submit -> Result: "5 · no replay or another copy"
